  "goodToKnow": "Der Märtyrer (die Märtyrerin) is a martyr, someone who suffers or dies for their faith or convictions. Dietrich Bonhoeffer, the Protestant pastor executed by the Nazis in 1945, is honoured as a modern martyr. Colloquially, den Märtyrer spielen means to play the martyr. Das Martyrium is martyrdom and also an ordeal. From Greek martys (witness). Plural: die Märtyrer."
